    <span style="display:inline-block;background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;font-weight:600;font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px;">Finding</span>
    <div style="font-size:13px;color:#1a2332;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;">16 leads from $1,389 across 12 ads. Blended CPL: $87. 6 ads spent $313 with zero leads.</div>
</div><div class="cards-grid"><div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
        <div class="ad-name">Carousel GIF | On Island Transfer | Ad #1 Short | 31 Mar 2026</div>
        <div class="campaign-name" title="Warp | Bofu | Conversions - Cold | SG | 0/01/2026">Warp | Bofu | Conversions - Cold | SG | 0/01/2026</div>
    </div>
